<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said analyst Larry Keusch started coverage of Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc on Thursday with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>The shares rose 1-1/8 to 20-1/8 in early trading.</p>
